          "id": 705655351,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "This MR gives compiler warnings (treated as errors) on raspberry pi.\n```\n../epan/dissectors/packet-quic.c: In function ‘quic_streams_add’:\n../epan/dissectors/packet-quic.c:3814:50: error: cast to pointer from integer of different size [-Werror=int-to-pointer-cast]\n     if (!wmem_list_find(quic_info->streams_list, (void *)(stream_id))) {\n                                                  ^\n../epan/dissectors/packet-quic.c:3815:58: error: cast to pointer from integer of different size [-Werror=int-to-pointer-cast]\n         wmem_list_insert_sorted(quic_info->streams_list, (void *)(stream_id),\n                                                          ^\n../epan/dissectors/packet-quic.c: In function ‘quic_get_stream_id_le’:\n../epan/dissectors/packet-quic.c:3868:13: error: cast from pointer to integer of different size [-Werror=pointer-to-int-cast]\n         if ((guint64)wmem_list_frame_data(curr_entry) > sub_stream_id &&\n             ^\n../epan/dissectors/packet-quic.c:3873:26: error: cast from pointer to integer of different size [-Werror=pointer-to-int-cast]\n         prev_stream_id = (guint64)wmem_list_frame_data(curr_entry);\n                          ^\n../epan/dissectors/packet-quic.c: In function ‘quic_get_stream_id_ge’:\n../epan/dissectors/packet-quic.c:3901:13: error: cast from pointer to integer of different size [-Werror=pointer-to-int-cast]\n         if ((guint64)wmem_list_frame_data(curr_entry) >= sub_stream_id) {\n             ^\n../epan/dissectors/packet-quic.c:3903:41: error: cast from pointer to integer of different size [-Werror=pointer-to-int-cast]\n             *sub_stream_id_out = (guint)(guint64)wmem_list_frame_data(curr_entry);\n                                         ^\ncc1: all warnings being treated as errors\n```",
